1813:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\note When the preload mode is enabled, accessed registers are shadow registers.
1814:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c ****  *       Their content is transferred into the active register after an update request,
1815:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c ****  *       either software or synchronized with an event.
1816:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\param  SHRTIMx Super High Resolution Timer instance
