2141:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\fun  Set the timer counter value.
2142:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\note  This function can only be called when the timer is stopped.
2143:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\note  For HR clock prescaling ratio below 32 (CKPSC[2:0] < 5), the least
2144:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c ****  *        significant bits of the counter are not significant. They cannot be
2145:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c ****  *        written and return 0 when read.
2146:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\note The timer behavior is not guaranteed if the counter value is set above
2147:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c ****  *       the period.
2148:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\param  SHRTIMx Super High Resolution Timer instance
2149:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\param  Timer This parameter can be one of the following values:
2150:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_TIMER_MASTER
2151:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_TIMER_A
2152:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_TIMER_B
