2507:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c ****  *       that can be selected among the following sources:
2508:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - The timing unit: Compare 2, Compare 4 and Update (3 events).
2509:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - The master timer: Reset and Compare 1..4 (5 events).
2510:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - The external events EXTEVNT1..10 (10 events).
2511:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - All other timing units (e.g. Timer B..F for timer A): Compare 1, 2 and 4 (12 events).
