3756:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\note   This bit defines the compare 1 operating mode:
3757:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\note   0: the compare 1 event is generated when the counter is equal to the compare value
