3759:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\param  SHRTIMx Super High Resolution Timer instance
3760:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\param  Timer This parameter can be one of the following values:
3761:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_TIMER_A
