3856:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** /**
3857:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\fun  Select the roll-over mode.
3858:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\note Only significant in up-down counting mode (see function SHRTIM_TIM_SetCountingMode()).
3859:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\note Only concerns the Roll-over event with the following destinations: Update trigger, IRQ
3860:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c ****  *      and DMA requests, repetition counter decrement and External Event filtering.
3861:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\param  SHRTIMx Super High Resolution Timer instance
3862:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\param  Timer This parameter can be one of the following values:
3863:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_TIMER_A
3864:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_TIMER_B
3865:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_TIMER_C
3866:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_TIMER_D
3867:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_TIMER_E
3868:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_TIMER_F
3869:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\param  Mode This parameter can be one of the following values:
3870:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_ROLLOVER_MODE_PER
3871:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_ROLLOVER_MODE_RST
3872:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_ROLLOVER_MODE_BOTH
